  "description": "Designed for the messy, unpredictable, beautiful reality of riding fast, the Speedmachine 01 THREE excels whether it’s the second leg of your Ironman triathlon or a race against the clock. Born from a design collaboration between the BMC Impec Lab and Red Bull Advanced Technologies, this is the fastest triathlon bike the industry has ever produced.\nThe uncompromising 01 Premium Carbon layup provides the stiffness you need to push hard, paired with calm, predictable handling, allowing triathletes to stay low in the aerobars for longer. Extensive position adjustability meets integrated storage and aero-optimized bottles so that you get a powerful, sustainable setup.\nFinished with a full SHIMANO 105 Di2 groupset, and rolling on BMC AR 27 Tubeless wheels.",
